tton\" type=\"button\">\n            View Details<span class=\"msym text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"forward arrow icon in view details button\">arrow_forward</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-[#f1f3ff] rounded-[8px] p-3 flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"sync summary panel\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"sync summary icon and text block\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[18px] text-[#005454] shrink-0 mt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"sync icon\">sync</span>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"sync summary text block\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] leading-5 font-semibold\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"sync summary title\" data-reason=\"description text in panel is a templated dynamic summary\">Sync Summary</span>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] leading-4 text-[#3e4948]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"sync summary description text\" data-reason=\"text templated by script with crawl source counts\">34 crawled across 8 sources, 8 met your threshold (&gt;80%). Next scout run scheduled in 3h.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-[#e1e8fd]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"sync panel footer row with sources and action\">\n<span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3 font-medium text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"crawled sources list text\">Sources: HN, Greenhouse, Lever, RSS</span>\n<button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] leading-[14px] font-semibold text-[#005454] py-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"force refresh feed button\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"refresh icon in force refresh button\">refresh</span>Force Refresh Feed\n        </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<nav class=\"h-14 shrink-0 px-4 flex items-center justify-around bg-[#f9f9ff] border-t border-[#e1e8fd]\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"bottom tab navigation\">\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 min-w-[56px] min-h-[44px] text-[#005454]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"discover tab link (active)\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"explore icon in discover tab\">explore</span><span class=\"text-[11px] leading-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"discover tab label\">Discover</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 min-w-[56px] min-h-[44px] text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"saved tab link\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"bookmark icon in saved tab\">bookmark</span><span class=\"text-[11px] leading-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"saved tab label\">Saved</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 min-w-[56px] min-h-[44px] text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"applications tab link\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"work icon in applications tab\">work</span><span class=\"text-[11px] leading-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"applications tab label\">Applications</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 min-w-[56px] min-h-[44px] text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4\" data-name=\"profile tab link\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"tune icon in profile tab\">tune</span><span class=\"text-[11px] leading-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"profile tab label\">Profile</span>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>",
