ic</span>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6-2\" data-name=\"timezone text stack\">\n<span class=\"text-[12px] leading-4 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6-2-1\" data-name=\"timezone range text\">Worldwide or within +/- 4 hrs</span>\n<span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3 font-medium text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6-2-2\" data-name=\"reference timezone note\">Reference: UTC-5 (US Eastern)</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"msym text-[16px] text-[#3e4948] ml-auto shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6-3\" data-name=\"edit timezone pencil icon\">edit</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t border-[#e9edff] pt-3 flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"sources and crawlers section\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"sources section header row\">\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] leading-4 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"section title with icon\">\n<span class=\"msym text-[16px] text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hub network icon\">hub</span>Sources &amp; Crawlers\n          </span>\n<span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3 font-medium text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"connected sources count label\">3 Connected</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"sources list container\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-2.5 py-2 rounded-[8px] bg-[#f1f3ff]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"source row with toggle\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"source name and description stack\">\n<span class=\"text-[12px] leading-4 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"source name text\">Direct Careers Pages</span>\n<span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3 font-medium text-[#3e4948]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"source description text\">Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby ATS</span>\n</div>\n<span